{{Expand Japanese|大和大国魂神社}}
{{ill|Yamato Okunitama Shrine|ja|大和大国魂神社|simple}} (大和大国魂神社) is a [[shinto shrine]] dedicated to {{Ill|Yamato Okunitama|lt=Yamato Okunitama|ja|倭大国魂神|simple}} run by the {{Interlanguage link|Yamato no Kuni no Miyatsuko|lt=Yamato clan|ja|倭国造|simple}}.<ref name="awaji-island-japan-heritage-|-ama-who-supported-the-ancient-state-2023a">{{Cite web |title=Awaji Island Japan Heritage {{!}} Ama who supported the ancient state |url=http://kuniumi-awaji.jp/ |access-date=2023-11-25 |website=Awaji Island Japan Heritage {{!}} Ama who supported the ancient state |language=en}}</ref> It is the [[Ichinomiya|Ninomiya]] of [[Awaji Province]].

Prefecturally designated cultural property.<ref name="awaji-island-japan-heritage-|-ama-who-supported-the-ancient-state-2023a" />
[[ja:大和大国魂神社]][[simple:Yamato Okunitama Shrine]]
